@startuml
' UC15 - Xem cấu trúc chương trình
' Visible title omitted by the user's clarification so the existing validator can pass.
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:457; Instructor-only parent layout and index CourseBuilder.
' Request orchestration: frontend/src/components/layout/layout.instructor.course.tsx:35, :60, :65.
' Structure display: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.tsx:10, :41, :64, :117.
' Navigation/assessment placement: frontend/src/components/instructor/course.nav.tsx:40, :79.
' Course API: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:55 (fetchCourseStructureAPI).
' Assignment API: frontend/src/services/assessment.service.ts:49 (fetchAssignmentsAPI).
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47, :61, :64, :65.
' Environment mapping: frontend/src/config/env.ts:10; frontend/.env.development:10, :12.
' Checked local dev URLs: Course and Assessment both use http://localhost:8080.
' No frontend .env.local/.env.development.local overrides or inherited URL overrides were found.
' .env.example is not the selected development configuration. Production/runtime overrides are not verified.
' Gateway routes: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:40, :52.
' JWT context replacement: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:137.
' Course bootstrap: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40 (api prefix, URI version 1).
' Structure controller/service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:73;
' services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:195.
' Structure repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:108.
' Assessment bootstrap: services/assessment-service/src/main.ts:38.
' Assignment controller: services/assessment-service/src/modules/assessments/assessments.controller.ts:30.
' Assignment service: services/assessment-service/src/modules/assessments/assessments.service.ts:196, :499, :510.
' Assignment repository: services/assessment-service/src/modules/assessments/assessments.repository.ts:38.
' Actual HTTP wiring: services/assessment-service/src/infrastructure/clients/integrations.module.ts:20;
' services/assessment-service/.env:8, :9, :11 (Course URL localhost:8083, timeout 5000 ms, http mode).
' Hidden adapter: services/assessment-service/src/infrastructure/clients/course/http-course-service.client.ts:41.
' Authoring context: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:58;
' services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:141;
' services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:39.
' DB ownership: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18, :31, :67, :84, :104;
' services/assessment-service/prisma/schema.prisma:10.
' Prisma adapters: each service's src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts reads its DATABASE_URL.
' Checked database names only: course-service/.env:2 -> course_db;
' assessment-service/.env:3 -> assessment_db. Credentials are intentionally not reproduced.
' docs/source-of-truth does not exist; docs/business/requirements-support.md has no full definitions
' for BR-79, BR-99, BR-147, BR-291 or BR-285. Formal BR conformance is not claimed.
' Architecture ownership reference: docs/architecture/source-of-truth-migration-plan.md:184, :185, :193.

actor Instructor
boundary "Course Structure Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as CoursesController
participant ":CoursesService" as CoursesService
participant ":CoursesRepository" as CoursesRepository
participant ":AssessmentsController" as AssessmentsController
participant ":AssessmentsService" as AssessmentsService
participant ":AssessmentsRepository" as AssessmentsRepository
database "course_db" as CourseDB
database "assessment_db" as AssessmentDB

' Preconditions: authenticated Instructor with organizationId and a real Course UUID.
' JWT validation/token refresh and routine auth middleware are not the UC's main interaction.
' Gateway replaces browser-supplied context headers with trusted JWT context.
' The root alt describes complete structure-fetch outcomes, not a new check in React.
' Both root operands retain the independent Assignment request started by the second useEffect.
' par models independent requests, not a Promise.all barrier before rendering the structure.
' Failure operands intentionally summarize downstream internals when completion is not established.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open /instructor/courses/{courseId}/builder
activate Screen

alt Course structure loaded successfully
  par Load the Course structure
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> CoursesController: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure\nTrusted user context
    activate CoursesController
    CoursesController -> CoursesService: getStructure(user, courseId)
    activate CoursesService
    CoursesService -> CoursesService: Check Instructor and organization
    activate CoursesService
    deactivate CoursesService
    CoursesService -> CoursesRepository: findStructure(courseId, organizationId, userId)
    activate CoursesRepository
    CoursesRepository -> CourseDB: Read ordered Modules and Lessons\nAssigned Instructor and organization
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> CoursesRepository: Course tree and material required flags
    deactivate CourseDB
    CoursesRepository -->> CoursesService: Scoped Course tree
    deactivate CoursesRepository
    CoursesService -> CoursesService: Derive required flags\nand editing lock reason
    activate CoursesService
    deactivate CoursesService
    ' Lesson.required = any lesson.materials[].isRequired.
    ' Module.required = any module.lessons[].required; neither is a separate stored flag.
    ' findStructure sorts Module.position and Lesson.position ascending.
    ' This query does not filter disabled Lessons/Materials and loads no Quiz/Assignment.
    ' structureLocked = (lockedAt != null) OR (status == Submitted).
    ' Submitted reason takes precedence over the first-Enrollment lock reason.
    ' Locked/Submitted prevent structure editing, not this read.
    CoursesService -->> CoursesController: Structure, required flags and lock reason
    deactivate CoursesService
    CoursesController -->> Gateway: 200 OK - Course structure
    deactivate CoursesController
    Gateway -->> Screen: Course structure
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show Module/Lesson tree\nRequired flags and lock reason

  and Load Assignments independently
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/assessments/assignments\ncourseId
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> AssessmentsController: GET /api/v1/assessments/assignments\ncourseId and trusted user context
    activate AssessmentsController
    AssessmentsController -> AssessmentsService: listAssignments(user, courseId)
    activate AssessmentsService
    AssessmentsService -> AssessmentsService: Check Instructor and organization
    activate AssessmentsService
    deactivate AssessmentsService

    alt Assignments loaded successfully
      AssessmentsService -> CoursesController: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/authoring-context\nTrusted user context
      activate CoursesController
      ' Direct REST through HttpCourseServiceClient, not through API Gateway.
      ' COURSE_CLIENT_MODE=http; the hidden adapter adds headers and a 5000 ms timeout.
      CoursesController -> CoursesService: getAuthoringContext(courseId, organizationId)
      activate CoursesService
      CoursesService -> CoursesRepository: findAuthoringContext(courseId, organizationId)
      activate CoursesRepository
      CoursesRepository -> CourseDB: Read Course and chain owner\nCurrent organization
      activate CourseDB
      CourseDB -->> CoursesRepository: Course authoring context
      deactivate CourseDB
      CoursesRepository -->> CoursesService: Course and chain owner
      deactivate CoursesRepository
      CoursesService -->> CoursesController: Authoring context
      deactivate CoursesService
      CoursesController -->> AssessmentsService: 200 OK - authoring context
      deactivate CoursesController
      AssessmentsService -> AssessmentsService: Verify Course owner and tenant
      activate AssessmentsService
      deactivate AssessmentsService
      ' Context lookup filters organization; AssessmentsService additionally compares instructorId/userId.
      ' listAssignments does not reject a read just because the Course is Locked or Submitted.
      AssessmentsService -> AssessmentsRepository: findAssignmentsOfCourse(organizationId, courseId)
      activate AssessmentsRepository
      AssessmentsRepository -> AssessmentDB: Read Assignments by position\nSame organization and Course
      activate AssessmentDB
      ' kind=ASSIGNMENT; include submission count; disabled rows remain in the list.
      AssessmentDB -->> AssessmentsRepository: Assignments and submission counts
      deactivate AssessmentDB
      AssessmentsRepository -->> AssessmentsService: Assignment rows
      deactivate AssessmentsRepository
      AssessmentsService -->> AssessmentsController: Assignment summaries
      deactivate AssessmentsService
      AssessmentsController -->> Gateway: 200 OK - Assignment list
      deactivate AssessmentsController
      Gateway -->> Screen: Assignment list
      deactivate Gateway
      Screen -> Screen: Store Assignment items
      activate Screen
      deactivate Screen

    else Assignment loading failed
      ' Restore incoming executions for this alternative in PlantUML source order.
      activate Gateway
      activate AssessmentsController
      activate AssessmentsService
      ' HTTP error trace: Course context missing/not owned -> 404; upstream failure/timeout -> 503.
      ' No completed context lookup or Assessment DB query is assumed in this operand.
      AssessmentsService -->> AssessmentsController: Assignment lookup error
      deactivate AssessmentsService
      AssessmentsController -->> Gateway: 404 or 503 error
      deactivate AssessmentsController
      Gateway -->> Screen: Assignment data unavailable
      deactivate Gateway
      Screen -> Screen: Set Assignment data to null
      activate Screen
      deactivate Screen
    end
  end

  opt Assignment data is available
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show Assignments after Modules\nAnd Quiz navigation link
  end
  ' The structure is already visible when its request finishes; this opt does not delay that render.
  ' Empty Assignment items still show the section, its empty state and the Quizzes link.

else Structure lookup failed\nCourse missing or not assigned
  par Reject the scoped Course lookup
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> CoursesController: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure\nTrusted user context
    activate CoursesController
    CoursesController -> CoursesService: getStructure(user, courseId)
    activate CoursesService
    CoursesService -> CoursesService: Check Instructor and organization
    activate CoursesService
    deactivate CoursesService
    CoursesService -> CoursesRepository: findStructure(courseId, organizationId, userId)
    activate CoursesRepository
    CoursesRepository -> CourseDB: Read the assigned Course tree\nCurrent organization and Instructor
    activate CourseDB
    ' where: id=courseId AND organizationId=user.organizationId AND chain.instructorId=user.userId.
    CourseDB -->> CoursesRepository: No matching Course
    deactivate CourseDB
    CoursesRepository -->> CoursesService: No matching Course
    deactivate CoursesRepository
    CoursesService -->> CoursesController: Course not found
    deactivate CoursesService
    CoursesController -->> Gateway: 404 Not Found
    deactivate CoursesController
    Gateway -->> Screen: Structure load error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show error and Back to My Courses

  and The Assignment request still starts
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/assessments/assignments\ncourseId
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> AssessmentsController: GET /api/v1/assessments/assignments\ncourseId and trusted user context
    activate AssessmentsController
    AssessmentsController -> AssessmentsService: listAssignments(user, courseId)
    activate AssessmentsService
    ' Failure internals are summarized: missing/foreign Course or owner mismatch -> 404.
    ' A failing Course HTTP dependency can instead produce 503; do not claim its DB query completed.
    ' Assessment repository work cannot proceed without successful ownership verification.
    AssessmentsService -->> AssessmentsController: Assignment lookup error
    deactivate AssessmentsService
    AssessmentsController -->> Gateway: 404 or 503 error
    deactivate AssessmentsController
    Gateway -->> Screen: Assignment data unavailable
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -> Screen: Set Assignment data to null
    activate Screen
    deactivate Screen
    ' This independent response never replaces the structure error page with an outline.
  end
end

deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' Source/spec limits and intentional omissions:
' - 403 for a non-Instructor or missing organization exists in both services; outside the stated precondition.
' - The two React effects are separate. Assignment failure is non-blocking; there is no Promise.all.
' - onResponseError resolves HTTP error envelopes; the Assignment effect uses res.data?.items ?? null.
' - That effect has no catch for an Axios transport rejection; on initial mount it leaves the initial null state.
'   On later route changes a rejected request may leave older Assignment state; no invented recovery is shown.
' - The frontend, not CoursesService.getStructure, composes Assignment items with the Course outline.
' - UC15 does not call fetchQuizzesAPI. The Quizzes shortcut navigates to /builder/quizzes (UC18),
'   where frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.quizzes.tsx:63 actually fetches Quiz data.
' - No individual Quiz nodes or module-level Quiz placement are fabricated in this UC.
' - Assignments append after Modules in position order; they do not affect Module/Lesson required flags.
' - The Assignment response computes locked from submissions, but this outline shows Disabled, not item lock reasons.
' - Some UI controls have separate guards: Edit Structure checks Submitted only; Add Assignment remains visible.
'   Do not infer that every button is disabled by structureLocked.
' - Empty Course modules render "No Modules yet"; viewing does not write data or lock the Course.
' - No TenantClient, LearningClient, Enrollment query, storage call, presigned URL or Kafka publish executes here.
' - Tenant ownership and editing-lock behavior are source observations, not verified full BR definitions.
' Visual draw.io import: NOT VERIFIED; no remote renderer is used.
@enduml
